    {
      "text": "They flock in great numbers. Though small, they flap their wings with great power.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "Usually with a large flock, it is barely noticeable when alone. Its cries are very strident.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "Because they are weak individually, they form groups. However, they bicker if the group grows too big.",
      "version": "platinum"
    },
